1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,000
This world, a flood of color

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,019
Truth and lies, they blind our eyes

6
00:00:30,019 --> 00:00:33,060
Look with your heart, see it true

7
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:36,039
The truth is right in front of you

8
00:00:36,039 --> 00:00:39,060
Hey you, good or bad, truth or lies

9
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:42,060
Can't escape the gray smoke in your mind

10
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:45,039
Bring out all the courage you've got

11
00:00:45,039 --> 00:00:48,200
And maybe you can save this world

12
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:50,420
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

13
00:00:50,420 --> 00:00:53,820
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

14
00:00:53,820 --> 00:00:56,719
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

15
00:00:56,719 --> 00:01:11,219
To find out what love is

16
00:01:11,219 --> 00:01:14,620
Hawxing lands a temp job as a TV field reporter

17
00:01:14,620 --> 00:01:19,500
He joins host Miss MU to interview Mr. Meng, the town's most kind-hearted businessman

18
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:21,140
During the interview

19
00:01:21,140 --> 00:01:23,519
Mr. Meng's son is kidnapped

20
00:01:23,519 --> 00:01:27,879
But the couple doesn't seem too worried

21
00:01:27,879 --> 00:01:31,340
Hawxing intercepts the kidnapper's call signal

22
00:01:31,340 --> 00:01:34,019
The chase is on

23
00:01:34,019 --> 00:01:36,579
Is this love?

24
00:01:52,599 --> 00:01:53,019
Let me out

25
00:01:53,019 --> 00:01:54,420
I wanna go out and play

26
00:01:54,420 --> 00:01:56,359
Let's go watch a cartoon together.

27
00:01:56,359 --> 00:01:58,180
No, I'm going out.

28
00:01:58,180 --> 00:01:59,359
Behave yourself.

29
00:02:06,579 --> 00:02:18,000
Who are you?

30
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:20,639
My name is Hawxing.

31
00:02:20,639 --> 00:02:27,960
You... don't you feel any pain?

32
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:31,060
I... I don't feel pain.

33
00:02:36,580 --> 00:02:40,660
Your teddy bear is very obedient.

34
00:02:40,660 --> 00:02:42,660
Of course.

35
00:02:42,660 --> 00:02:44,420
When those bad guys tried to catch me,

36
00:02:44,420 --> 00:02:45,760
he also protects me.

37
00:02:45,760 --> 00:02:47,280
He even bit one.

38
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:49,080
Let's go.

39
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:50,960
I'll take you home.

40
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:52,500
Mm, big brother.

41
00:02:52,500 --> 00:02:53,800
Your hairstyle is really cool.

42
00:03:02,920 --> 00:03:03,880
Miss MU.

43
00:03:03,880 --> 00:03:05,939
You helped me find my son.

44
00:03:05,939 --> 00:03:09,240
Please give me a chance to thank you tonight.

45
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:13,500
Well, I didn't do much, Mr. Meng.

46
00:03:13,500 --> 00:03:16,620
How could that be? A beauty like you...

47
00:03:16,620 --> 00:03:19,159
just sitting across from me is the greatest help.

48
00:03:19,159 --> 00:03:21,139
You flatter me.

49
00:03:21,139 --> 00:03:23,960
I'd still suggest you go back and keep your son company.

50
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:26,699
By the way, this is premium lobster.

51
00:03:26,699 --> 00:03:28,939
Miss MU, hurry and try it.

52
00:03:28,939 --> 00:03:30,400
That's right, that's right.

53
00:03:35,939 --> 00:03:38,879
Ma'am, I have a question.

54
00:03:38,879 --> 00:03:40,780
Okay, please go ahead.

55
00:03:40,780 --> 00:03:45,659
Did you personally kidnap your son?

56
00:03:45,659 --> 00:03:51,699
The scars on your hand and the teeth marks on his teddy bear

57
00:03:51,699 --> 00:03:53,300
have matching scan results.

58
00:03:57,939 --> 00:04:00,379
Yes, I admit I did it.

59
00:04:00,379 --> 00:04:02,099
Why?

60
00:04:02,099 --> 00:04:06,139
I never meant to hurt my own child.

61
00:04:06,139 --> 00:04:10,219
Nor did I intend to gain anything through ransom.

62
00:04:10,219 --> 00:04:14,180
Material life means nothing to me anymore.

63
00:04:14,180 --> 00:04:21,219
I just wanted to know if he still has any feelings.

64
00:04:21,219 --> 00:04:25,240
Mr. Meng before was completely different from now.

65
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:27,879
He worked hard and built everything from nothing.

66
00:04:27,879 --> 00:04:30,060
He single-handedly founded the Tuna Town Grand Hotel.

67
00:04:30,060 --> 00:04:32,160
Becoming a famous entrepreneur far and wide.

68
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:34,120
But ever since he got money,

69
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:36,040
he completely changed.

70
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:37,459
He lost his ideals.

71
00:04:37,459 --> 00:04:38,560
His life became decadent.

72
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:40,019
Squandering money every day,

73
00:04:40,019 --> 00:04:40,899
living in a drunken stupor.

74
00:04:40,899 --> 00:04:42,959
I couldn't bear to see him continue like this.

75
00:04:42,959 --> 00:04:45,259
So I quietly helped him manage the business.

76
00:04:45,259 --> 00:04:46,759
Donating on his behalf

77
00:04:46,759 --> 00:04:47,600
Showing kindness

78
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:49,720
To help restore his lost image

79
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:52,439
But it was all in vain

80
00:04:52,439 --> 00:04:56,220
That's why

81
00:04:56,220 --> 00:04:59,160
You staged this fake kidnapping

82
00:04:59,160 --> 00:05:02,200
He's long since lost feelings for me

83
00:05:02,200 --> 00:05:04,160
In this world

84
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:08,620
There's nothing he cares about anymore

85
00:05:08,620 --> 00:05:10,900
He has no human feelings left

86
00:05:10,900 --> 00:05:12,940
Just like me...

87
00:05:12,940 --> 00:05:14,940
No feelings at all

88
00:05:14,940 --> 00:05:20,640
I truly wished

89
00:05:20,640 --> 00:05:22,220
I could reawaken his heart

90
00:05:22,220 --> 00:05:24,500
I know the consequences of my actions

91
00:05:24,500 --> 00:05:25,940
If you want to call the police

92
00:05:25,940 --> 00:05:27,200
Then go right ahead

93
00:05:33,199 --> 00:05:37,060
Love... feelings can drive people to do such strange things

94
00:05:45,219 --> 00:05:46,759
I never would have thought

95
00:05:46,759 --> 00:05:50,879
That this kidnapping was planned by Mrs. Meng

96
00:05:50,879 --> 00:05:51,980
Let's call the police

97
00:05:51,980 --> 00:05:55,579
Humans are truly hard to fathom

98
00:05:55,579 --> 00:05:56,819
You...

99
00:05:56,819 --> 00:05:58,180
Always acting so sharp

100
00:05:58,180 --> 00:06:00,000
But slow when it really counts

101
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:01,199
I'm calling the police!

102
00:06:01,199 --> 00:06:03,139
Now I finally get it.

103
00:06:03,139 --> 00:06:04,279
Poor Mrs. Meng.

104
00:06:04,279 --> 00:06:06,659
Now I don't envy her at all.

105
00:06:06,659 --> 00:06:06,939
Wait.

106
00:06:25,579 --> 00:06:32,000
Hey! What are you doing?

107
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:33,180
Let me go!

108
00:06:33,180 --> 00:06:34,279
Let go of me!

109
00:06:34,279 --> 00:06:37,159
Stop yelling.

110
00:06:37,159 --> 00:06:39,259
You can scream all you want, nobody's coming to save you.

111
00:06:39,259 --> 00:06:45,959
Mrs. Meng.

112
00:06:45,959 --> 00:06:47,139
What are you doing?

113
00:06:47,139 --> 00:06:50,419
Don't be so formal. Stop calling me Mrs. Meng.

114
00:06:50,419 --> 00:06:53,659
Soon we'll become one.

115
00:06:53,659 --> 00:06:55,019
No more you and me.

116
00:06:55,019 --> 00:06:57,719
What? Become one?

117
00:06:57,719 --> 00:07:01,479
Just put on these iron hats.

118
00:07:01,479 --> 00:07:04,259
And press the button on this machine.

119
00:07:04,259 --> 00:07:08,879
I'll become you, and you'll become me.

120
00:07:08,879 --> 00:07:10,599
We'll be united as one.

121
00:07:10,599 --> 00:07:14,399
You're beautiful. No wonder he loves your face.

122
00:07:14,399 --> 00:07:16,019
If I transfer my mind

123
00:07:16,019 --> 00:07:17,039
into your body,

124
00:07:17,039 --> 00:07:18,319
he'll love me too.

125
00:07:18,319 --> 00:07:20,159
Who is "he"?

126
00:07:20,159 --> 00:07:22,240
My husband, Mr. Meng.

127
00:07:22,240 --> 00:07:27,360
He's lost interest in everything in this world for years now.

128
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:29,860
And you completely fascinate him.

129
00:07:29,860 --> 00:07:33,100
I have to awaken the feelings he's kept dormant for so long.

130
00:07:33,100 --> 00:07:34,319
Mr. Meng

131
00:07:34,319 --> 00:07:35,259
To me?

132
00:07:35,259 --> 00:07:36,420
You're out of your mind!

133
00:07:36,420 --> 00:07:39,980
Do I look crazy to you?

134
00:07:39,980 --> 00:07:40,259
Yes

135
00:07:40,259 --> 00:07:42,220
You, without emotions...

136
00:07:42,220 --> 00:07:44,220
Two crazy kidnappings in a row.

137
00:07:44,220 --> 00:07:48,120
How did you find this place?

138
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:48,759
Somebody, come quick!

139
00:07:48,759 --> 00:07:49,280
Catch him!

140
00:07:49,280 --> 00:08:15,960
You failed.

141
00:08:15,960 --> 00:08:16,700
Let her go!

142
00:08:19,280 --> 00:08:32,399
Mommy has to leave you for a while.

143
00:08:32,399 --> 00:08:35,320
You're all alone.

144
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:37,000
Make sure you study hard.

145
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:38,259
Got it?

146
00:08:38,259 --> 00:08:41,160
Yeah, I will, Mom.

147
00:08:41,160 --> 00:08:43,639
Don't worry.

148
00:08:47,420 --> 00:08:48,259
Thanks, everyone.

149
00:08:48,259 --> 00:08:50,240
Allow me to say goodbye to my son one last time.

150
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:55,059
Twice in a row
kidnapped

151
00:08:55,059 --> 00:08:56,700
He will definitely be severely punished.

152
00:08:56,700 --> 00:08:58,399
But he donated all his property.

153
00:08:58,399 --> 00:09:00,000
Hopefully the judge will go a bit easier on him.

154
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:02,399
Turns out everyone

155
00:09:02,399 --> 00:09:03,980
is able to give love to others.

156
00:09:03,980 --> 00:09:05,740
Everyone

157
00:09:05,740 --> 00:09:07,539
also needs to receive love from others.

158
00:09:07,539 --> 00:09:09,919
I still need to learn slowly.

159
00:09:09,919 --> 00:09:12,519
Are you saying feelings need to be learned?

160
00:09:12,519 --> 00:09:13,700
Feelings

161
00:09:13,700 --> 00:09:15,679
are the most complex data computation.

162
00:09:15,680 --> 00:09:19,260
I wonder how Mr. Meng, who lost his property,

163
00:09:19,260 --> 00:09:22,120
is doing now.

164
00:09:29,100 --> 00:09:30,760
Hey, don't slack off.

165
00:09:30,760 --> 00:09:32,200
Don't think nobody's watching.

166
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:33,440
I'll dock your pay.

167
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:34,280
If I dock your pay,

168
00:09:34,280 --> 00:09:35,500
how will you afford to eat?

169
00:09:35,500 --> 00:09:37,740
This is so hard.

170
00:09:37,740 --> 00:09:39,760
Why is my life like this?

171
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:41,620
I regret it so much.

172
00:09:41,620 --> 00:09:42,620
[Ending Theme]

173
00:09:45,700 --> 00:09:51,440
What I really don't want

174
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:55,660
is being all alone and lonely.

175
00:09:55,660 --> 00:09:59,080
That chapter of life.

176
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:03,540
It's natural to feel a little sad

177
00:10:03,540 --> 00:10:06,680
Saying goodbye to today

178
00:10:06,680 --> 00:10:11,080
Always leaves us feeling lost

179
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:14,460
But look at tomorrow

180
00:10:14,460 --> 00:10:18,820
Waving at me from the horizon

181
00:10:18,820 --> 00:10:22,560
Every day is just sunrise and sunset

182
00:10:22,560 --> 00:10:26,560
Step into the world and dream some more

183
00:10:26,560 --> 00:10:31,580
Looking forward to every second, every moment of life

184
00:10:31,580 --> 00:10:38,300
My bright eyes are sparkling

185
00:10:38,300 --> 00:10:41,639
A smile that meets the sunshine

186
00:10:41,639 --> 00:10:46,879
Stepping quietly at the corner by Qian'an's home